    "quote": "## I-E. Odyssey I \u2014 Discovery\n\n**Mission:** Build the first real school of model/device facts.\n\n**Genes to express:**\n- architecture-diverse specimens\n- controlled experiments\n- negative science\n- ModelLake\n- genomes\n- laws with scope\n- transfer annotations\n- scientific receipts\n- model #2 completion\n- first cross-model surprises\n\n**Operating rule:** act only on genes whose prerequisites are physically or artifact-verifiably available. Missing prerequisites become explicit blockers or prerequisite WorkUnits; they do not justify fake completion.\n\n**Promotion gate:** this civilization advances only when a fresh process or unseen specimen/device can demonstrate the promised behavior through independent receipts, not because the implementation surface exists.\n\n**Self-refill triggers:** regression, new specimen, new device, new counterexample, new profiler bottleneck, failed transfer, stale assumption, or a newly available deterministic verifier.\n\n",
